      "description": "<p>Rescuers say four bodies found in search for team caught in Broad Peak avalanche, after trackers showed rapid descent</p><p>The world-renowned Nepali mountaineer Nirmal Purja – a former British special forces member – is among 11 climbers caught in a deadly avalanche on Pakistan’s Broad Peak.</p><p>The Alpine Club of Pakistan said “seven climbers have been spotted via aerial drone footage” adding that “their identities and condition cannot yet be verified”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/31/nirmal-purja-10-climbers-missing-pakistan-broad-peak-mountain\">Continue reading...</a>",
